  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26122",
    "sub_id": "00001",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>本課為班級活動，同學出席並認真參與即可，課程主要以議題單元方式引導學生探索內容，於班級活動課程中依單元性質，進行測評、問卷、訪談、或心得報告等作法，以了解學生單元學習情形，並將結果回饋相關課程進行後續之課程學習成效評估。</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "這堂課的人數比較多，還請尊重他人，並以合理、負責和禮貌的態度行事。\n上課時請勿聊天、睡覺或做其他非本課程相關事務，除分組進行討論外，否則請盡量不要打擾他人。\n當其他同學報告或提問時，請專心地聆聽。當您發言時，請面對同學大聲說話，讓同學能聽清楚。",
    "course_pol_en": "This class has a large number of students, so please be respectful of others and behave in a reasonable, responsible and courteous manner.\nDuring class, please refrain from chatting, sleeping or engaging in activities unrelated to the course. With the exception of group discussions, please try to avoid disturbing others.\nWhen other students are presenting or asking questions, listen carefully. When speaking, face your classmates and speak loudly so that everyone can hear clearly.",
    "course_rem": "課堂上會公佈我的每週請益時間，如有任何關於課程的問題，\n歡迎寄封電子郵件給我預約討論時間。",
    "course_rem_en": "I will announce my weekly office hours in class. If you have any questions about the course, please feel free to email me to arrange a meeting.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>這個班級時間旨在提供學生們與導師建立互動機會，形成良好夥伴關係，以期發展實現學生個人、學業、職涯目標，確保及達成學生學習成就。<br />\n也期望學生在學習評量中展現誠信，遵守各課程的考試規則和作業要求，避免抄襲、偽造資料等不誠信行為，<br />\n並學會尊重學術道德，避免未經授權使用他人作品；同時在班上互動時，尊重他人觀點，形成良好友善的交流。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>This session is designed to give students the opportunity to interact with their teachers and build strong partnerships to support their personal, academic and career development while ensuring their learning success.<br />\nStudents are expected to demonstrate integrity in their academic work by adhering to course examination rules and assignment requirements, and by avoiding dishonest behaviour such as plagiarism and fabrication of data. They should respect academic ethics by refraining from unauthorised use of the work of others. In addition, students are encouraged to interact respectfully and constructively in class to foster a positive and supportive learning environment.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
